INSERT INTO mail_templates (slug, name, segment, position, subject, preview, body) VALUES (
  $tpl$novena-2$tpl$, $tpl$Novena · Dec 3 — Day 1 · The first apparition$tpl$, $tpl$Novena$tpl$, 2,
  $tpl$Day 1 of the Novena — the first apparition$tpl$,
  $tpl$"Know that I am the Virgin Mary, Mother of the true God…"$tpl$,
  $tpl$Dear @firstname,

**Day 1 · December 3, 1531 at Tepeyac**

On that Saturday morning, Mary spoke to Juan Diego for the first time:

> *"My dear son, whom I love tenderly, know that I am the Virgin Mary, Mother of the true God, Giver and Maintainer of life, Creator of all things, Lord of heaven and earth, Who is in all places. I wish a temple to be erected here where I can manifest the compassion I have for the natives and for all who solicit my help."*

Your words, heavenly Mother, fill my heart with love and gratitude. I turn to you today confident of obtaining through your intercession the grace which will enable me to live in accordance with the teaching of your Divine Son. Do not abandon me in this vale of tears. Have compassion on my anxieties and cares.

Pray four Hail Marys — one for each apparition — and the Memorare.

[Full text of today's meditation and the Memorare →](https://primosmaternos.com/novena?utm_source=gmail&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=novena-2026&utm_content=day-1#day-1)

Peace Bill$tpl$
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO mail_templates (slug, name, segment, position, subject, preview, body) VALUES (
  $tpl$novena-3$tpl$, $tpl$Novena · Dec 4 — Day 2 · The words that anchor us$tpl$, $tpl$Novena$tpl$, 3,
  $tpl$Day 2 — "Am I not here who am your Mother?"$tpl$,
  $tpl$The words spoken on Mary's fourth visit to Juan Diego.$tpl$,
  $tpl$Dear @firstname,

**Day 2 · The fourth apparition**

On her fourth visit, Mary said to Juan Diego:

> *"Do not let anything afflict you, and do not be afraid of any illness or accident or pain. Am I not here who am your Mother? Are you not under my shadow and protection? Is there anything else that you need?"*

Turn then, most gracious Mother, your eyes of mercy towards me today. Make it possible for me to put all my troubles and worries at your feet. I know you will remember you are my Mother, and I am under your shadow and protection.

Four Hail Marys. The Memorare.

[Today's meditation →](https://primosmaternos.com/novena?utm_source=gmail&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=novena-2026&utm_content=day-2#day-2)

Peace Bill$tpl$
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO mail_templates (slug, name, segment, position, subject, preview, body) VALUES (
  $tpl$novena-4$tpl$, $tpl$Novena · Dec 5 — Day 3 · Juan Bernardino's healing$tpl$, $tpl$Novena$tpl$, 4,
  $tpl$Day 3 — "Immaculate Virgin Mary who crushed the Serpent"$tpl$,
  $tpl$The name Mary gave to Juan Diego's dying uncle.$tpl$,
  $tpl$Dear @firstname,

**Day 3 · The apparition to Juan Bernardino**

Juan Diego's uncle, Juan Bernardino, was near death. Mary appeared to him, cured him, and gave him her name — the name that told the Aztecs that their season of human sacrifice was ending:

> *"Immaculate Virgin Mary who crushed the Serpent."*

Hail Holy Queen, merciful Mother. Hail our life, our sweetness and our hope. Pray for us today. Exterminate the Serpent of Evil from our lives so we may be made worthy of the promises of Christ, your Divine Son.

Four Hail Marys. The Memorare.

[Today's meditation →](https://primosmaternos.com/novena?utm_source=gmail&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=novena-2026&utm_content=day-3#day-3)

Peace Bill$tpl$
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO mail_templates (slug, name, segment, position, subject, preview, body) VALUES (
  $tpl$novena-5$tpl$, $tpl$Novena · Dec 6 — Day 4 · The image as written message$tpl$, $tpl$Novena$tpl$, 5,
  $tpl$Day 4 — the image itself preaches$tpl$,
  $tpl$Every detail of the tilma told the Aztecs something specific.$tpl$,
  $tpl$Dear @firstname,

**Day 4 · The image as picture writing**

To an Aztec looking at the tilma in 1531, the image was a codex. Your regal figure in human form told them that your dwelling place had once been on earth. The rays of the sun, the clouds around your body, the stars on your garment, the crescent under your feet, the angel — all of them said: my home is now in heaven, and the human soul is immortal.

O Holy Mary, let the same image teach me never to forget the immortality of my soul, that Heaven is my goal and my inheritance. Amid the temptations of this life, let me think always of that home of peace and eternal bliss.

Four Hail Marys. The Memorare.

[Today's meditation →](https://primosmaternos.com/novena?utm_source=gmail&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=novena-2026&utm_content=day-4#day-4)

Peace Bill$tpl$
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO mail_templates (slug, name, segment, position, subject, preview, body) VALUES (
  $tpl$novena-6$tpl$, $tpl$Novena · Dec 7 — Day 5 · The rays of the sun$tpl$, $tpl$Novena$tpl$, 6,
  $tpl$Day 5 — eclipsing the sun-god$tpl$,
  $tpl$The Aztecs sacrificed thousands to the Sun. Then the tilma stood in front of it.$tpl$,
  $tpl$Dear @firstname,

**Day 5 · The rays of the sun**

For centuries the natives of Mexico worshipped the Sun. Countless human beings were sacrificed in its honor. When the Indians beheld the Image on the tilma — with her figure eclipsing the sun so that only its rays are visible — they understood the lesson.

O Holy Mary, through the mystery of the Incarnation of your Son, obtain for us the light to understand the greatness of the benefit he has bestowed upon us in becoming our Brother and in giving you, his own Mother, to be our Mother also.

Four Hail Marys. The Memorare.

[Today's meditation →](https://primosmaternos.com/novena?utm_source=gmail&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=novena-2026&utm_content=day-5#day-5)

Peace Bill$tpl$
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO mail_templates (slug, name, segment, position, subject, preview, body) VALUES (
  $tpl$novena-7$tpl$, $tpl$Novena · Dec 8 — Day 6 · The stars on the mantle$tpl$, $tpl$Novena$tpl$, 7,
  $tpl$Day 6 — the stars themselves testify$tpl$,
  $tpl$The stars on her mantle told the Aztecs their gods weren't gods.$tpl$,
  $tpl$Dear @firstname,

**Day 6 · The stars on the mantle**

The fires that had burned on the altars of the false gods were extinguished forever after the Indians contemplated the Image and saw her attired with the firmament, covered with stars. The stars had been made by the Invisible God to serve mankind — they could not themselves be deities to whom sacrifice was due.

Most Holy Mary, through the image stamped by God on the Indian's garment, you have brought millions of pagans into the light of the true faith. Obtain for me the grace of understanding the message it contains. Shed upon me the light of your countenance; direct and sanctify all my undertakings today.

Four Hail Marys. The Memorare.

[Today's meditation →](https://primosmaternos.com/novena?utm_source=gmail&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=novena-2026&utm_content=day-6#day-6)

Peace Bill$tpl$
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO mail_templates (slug, name, segment, position, subject, preview, body) VALUES (
  $tpl$novena-8$tpl$, $tpl$Novena · Dec 9 — Day 7 · The cross at her throat$tpl$, $tpl$Novena$tpl$, 8,
  $tpl$Day 7 — the small cross that opened the way$tpl$,
  $tpl$The same cross was on Cortés' banner. The Aztecs recognized it.$tpl$,
  $tpl$Dear @firstname,

**Day 7 · The cross of our redemption**

At her throat, the tilma bears a small black cross on a gold brooch. It was the same cross the Aztecs had seen on the banner of Hernando Cortés. When they saw it on her image, they went to the Spanish missionaries eager to know its meaning — and were told of the Savior who came from heaven to redeem the human race, and of the Virgin Mother of that Savior.

Holy Virgin, Mary of Guadalupe, my Queen and Mother, inspire us to see in this miraculous picture the instrument of conversion, you who are the adorable Queen and Mother of the Apostles and Missionaries.

Four Hail Marys. The Memorare.

[Today's meditation →](https://primosmaternos.com/novena?utm_source=gmail&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=novena-2026&utm_content=day-7#day-7)

Peace Bill$tpl$
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO mail_templates (slug, name, segment, position, subject, preview, body) VALUES (
  $tpl$novena-9$tpl$, $tpl$Novena · Dec 10 — Day 8 · The roses at Tepeyac$tpl$, $tpl$Novena$tpl$, 9,
  $tpl$Day 8 — "You are my ambassador worthy of confidence"$tpl$,
  $tpl$The last words Juan Diego heard from her lips.$tpl$,
  $tpl$Dear @firstname,

**Day 8 · The roses**

Juan Diego cut the roses blooming on the frozen hilltop and brought them down. Mary arranged them in his tilma with her own hands and tied it around his neck. The last words he heard from her:

> *"You are my ambassador worthy of confidence. Go in peace."*

The picture on that coarse cloth could not have been painted by human hands. It convinced the bishop, as it ought to convince every person who looks at it, that Juan Diego's message was truly hers.

Humbly, my Queen and Mother, let me be your ambassador like Juan Diego today — to give the doctrine contained in your Image to my friends, believers and unbelievers alike.

Four Hail Marys. The Memorare.

[Today's meditation →](https://primosmaternos.com/novena?utm_source=gmail&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=novena-2026&utm_content=day-8#day-8)

Peace Bill$tpl$
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO mail_templates (slug, name, segment, position, subject, preview, body) VALUES (
  $tpl$novena-10$tpl$, $tpl$Novena · Dec 11 — Day 9 · The conversion of a nation$tpl$, $tpl$Novena$tpl$, 10,
  $tpl$Day 9 — nine million baptisms in ten years$tpl$,
  $tpl$The last day of the Novena, the day before the feast.$tpl$,
  $tpl$Dear @firstname,

**Day 9 · The conversion of a nation**

O Holy Virgin, enthroned on the spot you chose in the very heart of an idolatrous nation, you worked its conversion. After seeing the Image on the tilma of their countryman, the Indians stripped their temples of idols. They built churches on whose towers gleaming crosses shone in the sun. The huge drum that had innumerable times announced human sacrifice was heard no more.

As Juan Diego spent the remaining seventeen years of his life giving your spoken message to the Indians, so permit me, my loving Mother, to help in making known your celestial message among my countrymen. Animate and bless all who join in the Apostleship and Novena, having as their banner your admirable image on Juan Diego's tilma, together with the cross, emblem of our redemption.

Four Hail Marys. The Memorare.

[Today's meditation →](https://primosmaternos.com/novena?utm_source=gmail&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=novena-2026&utm_content=day-9#day-9)

Tomorrow is the feast. A blessed vigil to you.

Peace Bill$tpl$
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

